00:25:15.732 --> 00:25:18.606
Once the lights were out and the place was locked up.

00:25:18.628 --> 00:25:21.386
The ball pit would be a much more comfortable place to sleep than the dirty kitchen floor.

00:25:21.418 --> 00:25:24.414
And the items at the bottom were probably a combination of McDonald's food

00:25:24.452 --> 00:25:26.978
dropped by kids and his own personal possessions.

00:25:27.074 --> 00:25:30.834
The reason why I bring up this theory is because not long after the alleged

00:25:30.882 --> 00:25:34.278
needle incident, stories of Ronald McDonald himself being spotted in the

00:25:34.284 --> 00:25:35.906
ball pits began to circulate.

00:25:36.018 --> 00:25:39.666
-[Jessii] And one night when an employee was shutting down the restaurant, he walked

00:25:39.698 --> 00:25:43.238
-[Jessii] into the play place just to make sure that everybody was out before he shut

00:25:43.254 --> 00:25:46.954
-[Jessii] it down, turned off the lights, locked the doors, and from the side of his eye

00:25:46.992 --> 00:25:50.006
-[Jessii] he saw this shadowed figure in the distance.

