-[Jessii] slowly, and he swears that he saw this red hair and pale face before it

00:26:05.172 --> 00:26:07.566
-[Jessii] quickly sunk underneath the surface. How creepy is that? 

00:26:07.678 --> 00:26:12.114
Other stories are told from the kid's perspective, like

